  "tag": "section",
  "class": "shopddf-retailstore-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "heading",
      "label": "Heading",
      "default": "Retail Store"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "body_text",
      "label": "Body text",
      "default": "<p>As Manhattan's sole travel retail boutique, ShopDDF has garnered an international reputation for excellence in quality, creativity, and uniqueness. Situated in the heart of Midtown Manhattan, our emphasis on exclusive products, extensive range of goods, competitive pricing, and dedicated focus have allowed us to build strong relationships with our clientele.</p><p>Whether you are traveling to or from New York City, a visit to our Diplomatic Duty Free Shops is sure to leave a lasting impression as a reflection of Manhattan's incomparable spirit as the world's greatest city. Our shop offers a wide selection of the most sought-after and esteemed brands, including designer skincare, cosmetics, fragrances, and food and gifts.</p><p>Our team of multilingual sales staff is always on hand to provide excellent customer service in any language that you feel most comfortable speaking. Additionally, our shop is conveniently located mere steps from the United Nations, making it a popular destination for members of the diplomatic and UN communities.</p>"
    },
